WEBVTT

00:24.830 --> 00:25.490
Again, bro.

00:25.510 --> 00:26.030
Again.

00:30.550 --> 00:31.610
Here, give it to me.

00:31.830 --> 00:32.240
Here.

00:33.350 --> 00:34.550
Come on, give it to me.

00:39.200 --> 00:39.920
Get ready.

00:41.110 --> 00:41.600
One,

00:42.030 --> 00:42.790
two,

00:43.200 --> 00:43.880
three!

00:43.620 --> 00:46.760
♪ The stars twinkle, the moon curves ♪

00:47.880 --> 00:48.280
Pull.

00:50.570 --> 00:55.320
♪ A gentle breeze
sways the willow branches ♪

00:57.890 --> 01:01.050
♪ The two of us, working late into the night,
sneak up to the base of the wall ♪

01:04.780 --> 01:07.830
♪ Sneaking around, peeking through ♪

01:12.510 --> 01:13.039
Again.

01:13.510 --> 01:14.039
Again.

01:14.480 --> 01:15.260
Again, bro.

01:15.480 --> 01:15.920
Come on.

01:15.920 --> 01:16.400
Here.

01:17.430 --> 01:18.200
Hold on, bro.

01:18.230 --> 01:18.690
Come on.

02:44.030 --> 02:47.720
[Born with Luck]

02:47.829 --> 02:50.680
[Episode 16]

03:00.400 --> 03:01.680
Mr. Zhou has something important today.

03:01.680 --> 03:02.800
You all, stay sharp.

03:02.800 --> 03:03.580
Not a single mistake is allowed,

03:03.580 --> 03:04.150
understand?

03:04.150 --> 03:04.880
Understood!

03:12.520 --> 03:13.250
Chief Zhang.

03:13.800 --> 03:15.000
Zhou Rong didn't go to his company today.

03:15.000 --> 03:16.190
He's moved all his people to his villa.

03:16.190 --> 03:18.520
Looks like something's happening today.

03:20.280 --> 03:20.880
Song Xing,

03:21.190 --> 03:22.710
notify everyone to be ready to act
at any moment.

03:22.710 --> 03:23.910
Alright, in a minute.

03:24.030 --> 03:24.630
Song Xing!

03:25.470 --> 03:25.870
You see,

03:25.870 --> 03:27.030
I just called Li Qian,

03:27.030 --> 03:28.000
but she suddenly hung up on me.

03:28.000 --> 03:28.800
I wanted to ask what was going on,

03:28.800 --> 03:30.310
but now I can't get through to her.

03:30.310 --> 03:32.510
Is this really the time to be doing that?

03:32.910 --> 03:33.310
Got it.

03:37.540 --> 03:40.950
[Baoku Fresh Produce Delivery Center]

03:45.310 --> 03:45.970
Delivery.

03:54.950 --> 04:01.820
[Baoku Fresh Produce Delivery Center]

03:55.190 --> 03:56.470
There are guests inside.

03:56.470 --> 03:59.280
Boss instructed to turn off
the surveillance cameras today.

03:59.280 --> 04:00.340
Rest assured, Gai.

04:02.910 --> 04:03.610
Go get the suitcase.

04:03.610 --> 04:04.240
Okay.

04:06.890 --> 04:14.160
[Baoku Fresh Produce Delivery Center]

04:10.960 --> 04:11.520
Gai.

04:13.560 --> 04:14.090
You punk.

04:15.030 --> 04:15.630
Come here.

04:18.510 --> 04:19.910
Do you think this is the right place
to park?

04:19.910 --> 04:20.630
Well, I...

04:20.720 --> 04:22.050
Go park in the backyard.

04:22.970 --> 04:24.430
Got it, got it. Right away.

04:24.430 --> 04:24.960
Hurry up.

04:25.680 --> 04:27.040
Why didn't you say anything
when I was parking?

04:27.040 --> 04:30.710
I've already parked here, and now
you start bringing up all this nonsense.

04:30.710 --> 04:33.240
These are all things
you need to watch out for.

04:40.380 --> 04:41.230
Hurry.

04:41.790 --> 04:42.200
Got it.

04:49.159 --> 04:50.190
Alright, let's go.

04:50.190 --> 04:51.120
Let's go inside.

05:04.120 --> 05:04.780
Who are you?

05:09.920 --> 05:11.040
The estate is too big.

05:11.040 --> 05:11.790
I got lost.

05:12.190 --> 05:12.910
You are...

05:13.040 --> 05:14.440
One of Mr. Zhou's guests?

05:17.680 --> 05:18.510
This way please.

05:18.510 --> 05:19.910
I'll take you to Mr. Zhou.

05:20.630 --> 05:21.720
If he's busy, forget it.

05:21.720 --> 05:22.250
Please.

05:22.360 --> 05:23.070
I wouldn't dare neglect

05:23.070 --> 05:24.070
Mr. Zhou's guest.

05:24.600 --> 05:25.060
Please.

05:33.270 --> 05:33.820
Mr. Zhou,

05:34.510 --> 05:35.840
your guest has arrived.

05:41.600 --> 05:43.930
It's about that matter Du Cong mentioned.

05:47.390 --> 05:47.950
Mr. Zhou.

05:51.600 --> 05:54.000
Take her to the room next to the study
and wait there for a bit.

05:54.000 --> 05:54.540
Yes.

05:55.640 --> 05:57.370
Please wait for me for a moment.

05:58.070 --> 05:58.530
Please.

06:14.430 --> 06:15.690
Everything is normal.

06:17.190 --> 06:18.120
Everything is normal.

06:18.120 --> 06:18.830
I heard.

06:23.040 --> 06:23.570
Mr. Zhou.

06:42.310 --> 06:42.920
Mr. Zhu.

06:49.300 --> 06:51.360
First time in Sanjiangkou, right?

06:55.240 --> 06:56.600
Hello, Mr. Zhou.

07:04.360 --> 07:05.160
I'm Zhu Yifei.

07:09.410 --> 07:10.100
Mr. Zhu.

07:12.070 --> 07:13.270
Mr. Zhou, even you didn't think

07:13.270 --> 07:14.550
I was the driver—

07:14.650 --> 07:16.180
so how could the police?

07:19.240 --> 07:20.040
Yes, exactly.

07:20.070 --> 07:22.100
True concealment is
blending into the crowd.

07:22.100 --> 07:24.430
Mr. Zhu, your way of doing things
really is

07:24.680 --> 07:25.480
different.

07:39.990 --> 07:41.590
-Uncle Yifei.
-Uncle Yifei.

08:03.270 --> 08:05.430
Dear Mr. Zhou, sorry

08:05.450 --> 08:06.560
to have kept you waiting.

08:06.560 --> 08:07.360
My apologies.

08:07.360 --> 08:08.990
I'm Zhu Yifei,

08:09.310 --> 08:10.910
and these are all my buddies.

08:11.070 --> 08:11.510
Zheng!

08:11.720 --> 08:12.120
Here!

08:12.240 --> 08:12.700
Chubby!

08:12.830 --> 08:13.160
Here!

08:13.240 --> 08:13.750
Scrawny!

08:13.750 --> 08:14.240
Here!

08:14.390 --> 08:15.750
We are all family.

08:17.510 --> 08:19.240
Mr. Zhu, you act with such caution.

08:19.240 --> 08:21.120
It's truly admirable.

08:21.140 --> 08:23.510
Well, actually, I get motion sickness
in small cars,

08:23.510 --> 08:25.440
so I arrived earlier in a larger vehicle.

08:25.440 --> 08:26.900
Understood, understood.

08:27.070 --> 08:28.270
What larger vehicle?

08:29.480 --> 08:30.680
Shall we go inside first?

08:30.680 --> 08:31.480
Sure, sure.

08:36.549 --> 08:37.669
Isn't he insane?

08:50.240 --> 08:50.790
Chubby.

08:51.000 --> 08:51.510
Here.

08:51.790 --> 08:52.720
Take someone

08:52.750 --> 08:54.030
and bring the suitcase over.

08:54.030 --> 08:54.480
Got it.

08:55.870 --> 08:56.670
Let's go, bro.

08:58.720 --> 08:59.720
Please go inside.

09:00.030 --> 09:00.960
Don't stand on ceremony.

09:00.960 --> 09:01.890
Please, please.

09:07.720 --> 09:10.250
He really doesn't stand on ceremony,
does he?

09:22.270 --> 09:23.400
Please, have a seat.

09:35.750 --> 09:36.280
Mr. Zhou.

11:00.550 --> 11:01.210
Keep watch.

11:19.960 --> 11:20.600
Mr. Zhou,

11:21.510 --> 11:23.240
let's not beat around the bush.

11:24.840 --> 11:25.940
I usually

11:26.030 --> 11:27.090
keep a low profile.

11:28.120 --> 11:29.580
This time I came in person,

11:30.030 --> 11:30.910
first because

11:31.200 --> 11:33.550
this deal involves
a significant amount of money,

11:33.550 --> 11:34.610
and second because

11:35.390 --> 11:37.450
I wanted to meet you myself, Mr. Zhou.

11:38.080 --> 11:39.960
You're young and promising, Mr. Zhou.

11:39.960 --> 11:42.090
We've made the right decision to come.

11:42.360 --> 11:42.890
Alright.

11:43.480 --> 11:45.510
I plan to stay in Sanjiangkou

11:45.600 --> 11:47.390
for 2 to 3 days.

11:48.000 --> 11:49.860
I hope that during this time,

11:50.030 --> 11:51.480
we can close the deal.

11:51.630 --> 11:52.670
No problem, right?

11:52.670 --> 11:53.330
No problem.

11:53.600 --> 11:55.000
I've got the money ready.

11:55.440 --> 11:55.910
Good.

12:47.320 --> 12:47.910
Mr. Zhu,

12:48.470 --> 12:49.870
this is just the deposit.

12:50.360 --> 12:52.160
Can I take a look at the goods now?

13:30.600 --> 13:32.050
It's just a minor trick,

13:33.270 --> 13:33.870
so that we can

13:33.870 --> 13:35.030
pass the security check

13:35.030 --> 13:37.030
without showing the shape of the money.

13:37.030 --> 13:38.430
Just an extra mechanism.

13:39.750 --> 13:41.210
-High-tech.
-High-tech.

13:44.480 --> 13:46.760
Can't you just pour it all in?

14:43.790 --> 14:44.510
What now?

14:47.150 --> 14:48.000
Now,

14:49.150 --> 14:50.550
I'll take my leave first.

14:51.750 --> 14:52.980
In half an hour,

14:53.200 --> 14:55.800
someone will deliver the goods here
in person.

14:56.030 --> 14:56.670
Leave?

14:57.480 --> 14:58.270
You want to leave?

14:58.270 --> 14:59.750
But I haven't even seen the goods yet.

14:59.750 --> 15:00.550
That's right.

15:00.910 --> 15:02.030
In half an hour,

15:02.200 --> 15:03.460
you will see the goods.

15:05.510 --> 15:06.710
Then please, Mr. Zhu,

15:06.910 --> 15:08.110
stay for another half hour with me.

15:08.110 --> 15:09.600
So you still don't trust me.

15:09.600 --> 15:11.330
Well, I haven't seen the goods.

15:12.350 --> 15:17.820
♪ Doubt ♪

15:18.320 --> 15:19.850
Here's the thing, Mr. Zhou.

15:19.910 --> 15:22.890
I never do transactions with the goods
right in front of me.

15:22.890 --> 15:23.980
That's my rule.

15:24.000 --> 15:25.130
Please understand.

15:25.320 --> 15:26.720
I also have my rule:

15:26.910 --> 15:28.290
cash on delivery.

15:28.320 --> 15:30.180
One million is not a small amount.

15:30.320 --> 15:31.980
If I don't see the goods today,

15:32.240 --> 15:33.600
you, you,

15:34.200 --> 15:35.260
and all the vehicles—

15:35.260 --> 15:36.590
none of you are leaving.

15:41.630 --> 15:43.200
And if I refuse?

16:16.000 --> 16:16.730
It wasn't me.

16:17.030 --> 16:18.230
It wasn't me, either.

16:19.150 --> 16:20.550
Then it must've been Mr. Zhu.

16:20.550 --> 16:21.680
It must've been you.

16:22.320 --> 16:22.960
Bro.

16:24.240 --> 16:25.440
Is your last name Huo?

16:27.560 --> 16:29.140
Your mentor's cousin

16:29.550 --> 16:30.750
and my second aunt's nephew

16:30.750 --> 16:32.010
are brothers-in-law.

16:32.200 --> 16:33.230
In that case,

16:33.750 --> 16:35.010
we are also relatives.

16:36.480 --> 16:38.600
There's a place for entertainment

16:38.790 --> 16:40.120
in the basement of Fenglinwan Hotel.

16:40.120 --> 16:41.350
If you guys are interested,

16:41.350 --> 16:42.060
you can go find

16:42.060 --> 16:43.460
a manager surnamed Zhou.

16:43.550 --> 16:45.600
She'll make the arrangements for you.

16:45.600 --> 16:48.000
Try the services in Sanjiangkou, alright?

16:57.030 --> 16:58.490
If this deal goes through,

16:58.720 --> 17:00.250
it'll be good for both of us,

17:00.750 --> 17:01.360
right?

17:15.790 --> 17:17.750
My mentor does have a cousin.

17:18.240 --> 17:18.920
I made it up.

17:20.829 --> 17:22.720
Since there's a family connection here,

17:22.720 --> 17:24.599
we can talk things through.

17:26.109 --> 17:27.970
I'm willing to make an exception.

17:29.640 --> 17:31.100
Thank you then, Mr. Zhu.

17:31.920 --> 17:32.580
Please sit.

17:33.440 --> 17:33.920
Okay.

17:48.510 --> 17:53.510
[Protect Forest Resources,
Strictly Prevent Forest Fires]

17:53.890 --> 17:56.140
[Depart in 15 minutes.]

17:54.920 --> 17:56.120
Depart in 15 minutes.

17:56.160 --> 17:58.320
[Go to Zhou Rong's villa.
Sturdy will meet you there.]

17:56.200 --> 17:57.200
Go to Zhou Rong's villa.

17:57.200 --> 17:58.240
Sturdy will meet you there.

17:58.240 --> 17:59.160
Got it.

17:58.340 --> 18:00.350
[Got it.]

18:09.060 --> 18:10.530
[Photographs of Cultural Relics]

18:10.530 --> 18:13.570
[Purchase Receipt]

18:16.030 --> 18:16.830
Why are you driving so slow?

18:16.830 --> 18:17.630
Drive faster.

18:26.200 --> 18:26.690
Boss.

18:26.720 --> 18:28.180
I-I need to take this call.

18:29.480 --> 18:31.200
You'd better not use your phone
while driving.

18:31.200 --> 18:32.350
But it's my boss calling.

18:32.350 --> 18:34.080
He must need something from me.

18:36.510 --> 18:37.570
[Gai]

18:38.480 --> 18:40.000
Gai, I'll be there in a few minutes.

18:40.000 --> 18:40.750
The owner of Jinxin Repair Shop

18:40.750 --> 18:41.560
in Qilihe

18:41.750 --> 18:42.640
just called me.

18:43.240 --> 18:44.350
He said there's a Xiali taxi

18:44.350 --> 18:45.950
with its rear bumper dented.

18:46.200 --> 18:47.790
That must be them, Gai.

18:48.790 --> 18:49.680
Can you ask the owner

18:49.680 --> 18:50.940
to stall them for a bit?

18:50.960 --> 18:52.070
I'll head over once I'm done here.

18:52.070 --> 18:52.530
No need.

18:53.030 --> 18:54.490
I know those two bastards.

18:54.590 --> 18:55.880
As soon as I'm done here,

18:55.880 --> 18:56.750
I'll take you to their house

18:56.750 --> 18:57.610
to corner them.

18:57.640 --> 18:58.790
[Protect Forest Resources,
Strictly Prevent Forest Fires]

18:58.070 --> 18:58.880
Thanks, Gai.

18:59.420 --> 18:59.960
Got it.

19:00.380 --> 19:01.440
[Gai]

19:00.750 --> 19:01.280
Alright.

19:07.440 --> 19:08.170
Did we crash?

19:09.340 --> 19:12.030
[Loyalty]

19:12.920 --> 19:13.310
Okay.

19:14.480 --> 19:15.210
Okay, got it.

19:15.880 --> 19:16.590
The fresh produce truck
that delivered food

19:16.590 --> 19:17.550
to Zhou Rong yesterday

19:17.550 --> 19:18.880
went there again today.

19:20.630 --> 19:22.070
How can they possibly eat that much?

19:22.070 --> 19:23.160
Even if they can eat a lot,

19:23.160 --> 19:25.960
they can't go through
an entire truckload in a day.

19:26.160 --> 19:27.030
Maybe they just have a lot of people?

19:27.030 --> 19:27.790
Go ask our cafeteria

19:27.790 --> 19:29.000
how often they restock.

19:29.000 --> 19:29.680
How can Zhou Rong's men

19:29.680 --> 19:31.010
possibly outnumber us?

19:33.920 --> 19:35.450
The bianzhong has arrived.

19:37.680 --> 19:39.210
The bianzhong has arrived.

19:39.510 --> 19:40.110
Let's go!

19:46.830 --> 19:47.480
Buddy,

19:48.200 --> 19:49.860
you can't blame this all on me.

19:50.400 --> 19:51.070
How could you just

19:51.070 --> 19:53.130
park on the side of the road like that?

19:53.270 --> 19:54.730
Did you rear-end me or not?

19:54.920 --> 19:55.400
Yes.

19:56.830 --> 19:58.830
I should take full responsibility.

20:06.480 --> 20:07.540
What are you doing?

20:08.270 --> 20:09.400
Calling the police.

20:11.000 --> 20:12.640
Let's not trouble the police.

20:12.640 --> 20:14.040
It's such a small matter.

20:14.070 --> 20:15.600
We can settle it ourselves.

20:18.160 --> 20:19.690
Let's just leave it at that.

20:22.160 --> 20:23.570
Leave it at that?

20:37.400 --> 20:38.530
I'm easy to talk to.

20:38.880 --> 20:39.720
If it were someone else,

20:39.720 --> 20:41.720
you wouldn't be able to leave today.

20:41.830 --> 20:42.440
Buddy.

20:45.790 --> 20:47.570
This is a Mercedes.

20:48.590 --> 20:49.670
What can

20:50.030 --> 20:51.160
100 yuan even cover?

20:55.590 --> 20:56.720
How much do you want?

20:57.200 --> 20:58.570
Since this guy is willing to pay,

20:58.570 --> 21:00.170
I should ask for at least 500.

21:06.000 --> 21:06.930
Look at this—

21:07.030 --> 21:08.290
the bumper is smashed.

21:09.740 --> 21:10.910
At the very least,

21:11.640 --> 21:12.680
it's going to cost this much.

21:12.680 --> 21:13.480
Where am I supposed to steal

21:13.480 --> 21:14.540
5,000 yuan for you?

21:18.400 --> 21:20.690
If you can't steal

21:20.720 --> 21:21.720
5,000 yuan for me,

21:22.200 --> 21:23.800
t-then I'll call the police.

21:24.510 --> 21:25.400
What do you want?

21:25.400 --> 21:26.460
What are you doing?

21:26.480 --> 21:27.740
Your car crashed mine!

21:27.960 --> 21:29.020
What are you doing?

21:30.420 --> 21:32.820
A gentleman uses his tongue,
not his fists!

21:33.070 --> 21:33.640
We can talk this over.

21:33.640 --> 21:34.660
A gentleman uses his tongue,
not his fists!

21:34.660 --> 21:35.460
A gentleman uses his tongue...

21:35.460 --> 21:36.920
A gentleman uses his tongue,
not his fists.

21:36.920 --> 21:39.320
A gentleman uses his tongue,
not his fists.

21:39.920 --> 21:41.310
Isn't this just about 5,000 yuan?

21:41.310 --> 21:41.840
I'll pay.

21:42.480 --> 21:43.010
Alright?

21:43.200 --> 21:43.920
Boss,

21:44.270 --> 21:45.200
what does this have to do with you?

21:45.200 --> 21:46.510
He's paying me 5,000.

21:50.070 --> 21:51.800
What kind of situation is this?

21:52.270 --> 21:54.160
You think I don't know traffic rules?

21:54.160 --> 21:55.360
This is rear-ending.

21:55.440 --> 21:57.420
You're supposed to
take full responsibility.

21:57.420 --> 21:58.080
Keep quiet.

22:01.930 --> 22:02.530
Sir,

22:02.600 --> 22:03.470
it's our fault.

22:04.160 --> 22:06.330
I'll give you 5,000 yuan,

22:07.000 --> 22:08.460
but don't call the police.

22:09.790 --> 22:10.460
Okay.

22:14.590 --> 22:15.480
Only 5,000?

22:20.590 --> 22:21.210
10,000?

22:22.600 --> 22:23.280
10,000?

22:23.690 --> 22:24.910
I'll give you 10,000,

22:24.960 --> 22:27.090
but promise you won't call the police.

22:30.440 --> 22:31.150
Wait,

22:31.270 --> 22:32.930
why should you give him money?

22:33.270 --> 22:33.920
Boss.

22:35.790 --> 22:36.270
50,000.

22:37.440 --> 22:39.270
One penny less and I'll call the cops.

22:39.270 --> 22:40.200
You little runt.

22:40.200 --> 22:41.270
How can you be so shameless?

22:41.270 --> 22:42.400
Why are you talking so...

22:42.400 --> 22:43.550
Why are you talking so...

22:43.550 --> 22:44.110
See if I dare to call the police!

22:44.110 --> 22:44.590
50,000!

22:45.550 --> 22:46.280
50,000 it is!

22:46.880 --> 22:47.690
I agree.

22:48.110 --> 22:48.480
Okay.

22:48.920 --> 22:51.450
But I don't have that much cash
on me right now.

22:51.480 --> 22:51.920
Go and

22:52.680 --> 22:53.750
give Mr. Zhou a call.

22:53.750 --> 22:55.200
Tell him to bring the money right away.

22:55.200 --> 22:55.880
Hurry up!

22:56.070 --> 22:57.000
Just ignore him.

22:57.070 --> 22:58.030
He wouldn't dare.

22:58.030 --> 22:58.840
Watch me!

22:59.000 --> 22:59.800
Make the call!

23:00.000 --> 23:00.550
Make the call!

23:00.550 --> 23:01.590
Why do you have so much to say?

23:01.590 --> 23:02.270
You're really...

23:02.270 --> 23:03.710
It's no big deal. You...

23:04.160 --> 23:04.920
Just let him call the police.

23:04.920 --> 23:05.830
Pay to avoid trouble, okay?

23:05.280 --> 23:07.090
[Photographs of Cultural Relics]

23:06.590 --> 23:07.160
Pay to avoid trouble.

23:07.160 --> 23:08.310
He wouldn't dare at all.

23:08.310 --> 23:09.170
What if he does?

23:09.480 --> 23:10.910
Look at his runty face.

23:10.010 --> 23:12.140
[Purchase Receipt]

23:18.200 --> 23:19.300
2.5 million.

23:18.400 --> 23:19.330
[2.5 million yuan]

23:19.410 --> 23:20.420
I'll give you 800,000.

23:19.690 --> 23:22.820
[800,000 yuan]

23:20.920 --> 23:22.130
For such a big deal,

23:22.160 --> 23:23.440
you say you'll give me 800,000.

23:23.440 --> 23:24.590
Then what do you make?

23:24.590 --> 23:26.070
You think I'm doing this for money?

23:25.940 --> 23:26.600
[Purchase Receipt]

23:26.600 --> 23:27.010
[Its estimated value is 43 million yuan.]

23:29.440 --> 23:30.830
That Mr. Zhou you just mentioned—

23:30.830 --> 23:32.890
is he Zhou Rong from Rongcheng Group?

23:33.270 --> 23:33.680
Who?

23:34.640 --> 23:35.240
Is he?

23:35.560 --> 23:36.490
I don't know him.

23:37.920 --> 23:38.850
I don't know him.

23:40.920 --> 23:42.050
How dare he lie to me?

23:55.200 --> 23:55.750
Mr. Zhu.

23:56.480 --> 23:57.340
How much longer

23:57.590 --> 23:58.590
do we have to wait?

23:59.510 --> 24:01.200
That bastard Liu Bei ran off.

24:10.200 --> 24:11.530
Have the goods arrived?

24:11.640 --> 24:13.510
We ran into a bit of trouble

24:13.750 --> 24:15.280
during the transportation

24:16.310 --> 24:18.270
of the goods.

24:18.440 --> 24:19.300
How about this?

24:19.480 --> 24:20.030
Mr. Zhou,

24:20.270 --> 24:22.130
you keep the money for now.

24:22.270 --> 24:23.620
Once I've dealt with it,

24:23.720 --> 24:25.120
I'll contact you right away.

24:25.120 --> 24:26.810
So what kind of problem is it?

24:27.030 --> 24:27.960
Just a minor issue—

24:27.960 --> 24:28.790
easy to fix.

24:29.310 --> 24:30.270
Mr. Zhu, I...

24:30.310 --> 24:30.990
You two.

24:34.960 --> 24:35.720
Stay.

24:42.590 --> 24:43.680
They just left like that?

24:43.680 --> 24:46.110
Wait, those two were here
to pull a fast one, weren't they?

24:46.110 --> 24:47.910
Trying to scam me, weren't they?

24:50.440 --> 24:51.500
That shouldn't be.

24:52.110 --> 24:53.000
Is Zhu Yifei not planning

24:53.000 --> 24:54.860
to stay in this business anymore?

24:57.640 --> 24:59.790
L-L-Let Fang Yong go back first.

25:28.640 --> 25:30.240
Are we getting back on the road or not?

25:30.240 --> 25:31.470
Yes, yes, we are.

25:34.350 --> 25:35.550
Let me take this call.

25:36.960 --> 25:37.630
Ren.

25:38.510 --> 25:39.440
I'm on my way.

25:39.880 --> 25:40.610
It went well.

25:41.310 --> 25:42.030
Very well.

25:42.590 --> 25:43.310
Got it.

25:45.550 --> 25:46.510
What now?

25:51.680 --> 25:53.210
The deal's been called off.

25:53.550 --> 25:54.110
My boss told me

25:54.110 --> 25:55.570
to take you straight home.

25:55.750 --> 25:57.550
No need to meet the boss anymore.

26:08.790 --> 26:09.520
Rong.

26:09.750 --> 26:11.200
What are you looking for? Let me help you.

26:11.200 --> 26:13.600
Do you have a charging cable
for this phone?

26:18.000 --> 26:18.550
Pull.

26:30.030 --> 26:30.920
This is about it.

26:30.920 --> 26:31.850
This could work.

26:38.350 --> 26:38.950
It worked.

26:39.160 --> 26:39.760
It worked.

26:40.070 --> 26:41.310
It worked. It worked.

26:41.440 --> 26:41.960
It worked.

26:41.940 --> 26:44.100
♪ The sun is setting ♪

26:48.640 --> 26:49.840
Let's try again, bro.

26:50.440 --> 26:51.000
Again.

27:06.510 --> 27:07.310
What the hell.

27:08.200 --> 27:09.330
Lang Bowen's phone?

27:10.200 --> 27:11.160
Wasn't this phone smashed

27:11.160 --> 27:11.820
and burned?

27:11.920 --> 27:13.440
Exactly. D-Didn't I smash it?

27:13.440 --> 27:14.000
You did.

27:14.590 --> 27:15.440
I saw it with my own eyes

27:15.440 --> 27:16.570
that you smashed it.

27:16.750 --> 27:17.880
How is it back again?

27:19.330 --> 27:21.530
The right side is too high. Move it down.

27:22.230 --> 27:23.420
Let me see.

27:27.090 --> 27:28.290
A bit more. A bit more.

27:28.480 --> 27:30.340
Still too high. Move it down a bit.

27:31.920 --> 27:32.880
All of you, get out.

27:32.880 --> 27:33.640
We're almost done here, Rong.

27:33.640 --> 27:34.200
Get out!

27:35.310 --> 27:36.390
Leave. Go on.

27:36.480 --> 27:37.160
Hurry up!

27:40.210 --> 27:41.680
That guy Lu has been causing trouble

27:41.680 --> 27:42.750
for you again and again.

27:42.750 --> 27:43.920
He even went after Ye Jian.

27:43.920 --> 27:45.350
You said it yourself to kill him,

27:45.350 --> 27:46.240
to let him know who's in charge

27:46.240 --> 27:47.000
in Sanjiangkou.

27:47.000 --> 27:48.600
I was just saying it offhand!

27:53.400 --> 27:54.600
Come on, give it to me.

27:55.200 --> 27:55.640
Rong!

28:05.200 --> 28:05.940
Huo Zheng

28:06.030 --> 28:08.090
picked it up from the ground just now.

28:09.000 --> 28:09.750
Amazing.

28:10.680 --> 28:12.680
It's been there for 6 months
and we never noticed it,

28:12.680 --> 28:14.610
but he saw it a-as soon as he came in?

28:14.920 --> 28:15.330
This is...

28:15.330 --> 28:16.250
Unreasonable,

28:17.240 --> 28:17.770
isn't it?

28:18.000 --> 28:19.530
It's way too unreasonable.

28:22.000 --> 28:22.750
Before they came,

28:22.750 --> 28:24.350
I had someone clean the room.

28:24.680 --> 28:25.370
I'll go ask them

28:25.370 --> 28:27.030
if anyone has seen this phone.

29:04.070 --> 29:04.800
How did it go?

29:05.030 --> 29:05.880
No one saw it.

29:06.030 --> 29:06.850
Right?

29:07.110 --> 29:08.270
It's obvious that this phone

29:08.270 --> 29:09.590
was brought by Zhu Yifei himself.

29:09.590 --> 29:10.510
But how did they even get

29:10.510 --> 29:11.170
this phone?

29:11.240 --> 29:12.170
How would I know?

29:12.200 --> 29:13.030
That guy Huo just came in

29:13.030 --> 29:14.330
and gave me the phone!

29:15.480 --> 29:16.680
Rong, did you take your medication today?

29:16.680 --> 29:17.550
What medication!

29:17.550 --> 29:19.110
Things are getting
more and more confusing now!

29:19.110 --> 29:19.880
That Zhu Yifei came in

29:19.880 --> 29:20.920
acting all mysterious, right?

29:20.920 --> 29:21.960
One moment this guy is Mr. Zhu,

29:21.960 --> 29:22.880
the next moment that guy is Mr. Zhu.

29:22.880 --> 29:24.280
Is he crazy or something?

29:25.000 --> 29:26.000
I can't figure out

29:26.110 --> 29:26.890
Zhu Yifei's

29:26.920 --> 29:27.480
game,

29:28.160 --> 29:29.160
but that guy he brought,

29:29.160 --> 29:30.640
Huo Zheng, is a badass.

29:30.880 --> 29:33.030
His nickname is "Huoxiang Zhengqi Water."

29:33.030 --> 29:34.720
He used to be a professional hitman

29:34.720 --> 29:36.550
and has several lives on his hands.

29:36.550 --> 29:37.960
He's been out of sight
for the past few years,

29:37.960 --> 29:38.550
and who knows

29:38.550 --> 29:38.960
why he ended up working for

29:38.960 --> 29:39.920
that Zhu guy.

29:42.270 --> 29:42.880
Zhu Yifei

29:44.160 --> 29:45.090
wants to kill me?

29:45.790 --> 29:47.250
But I have no beef with him!

29:50.590 --> 29:51.160
Rong,

29:52.070 --> 29:52.750
maybe we should put

29:52.750 --> 29:54.680
the matter of the bianzhong
on hold for a bit.

29:54.680 --> 29:56.540
I feel like it's too complicated.

29:57.110 --> 29:58.970
The deal can be put on hold for now,

29:59.030 --> 30:01.310
but we can't just stay here
like sitting ducks.

30:01.310 --> 30:02.030
Have Li Penggai

30:02.030 --> 30:03.070
stay here with a few people to keep watch.

30:03.070 --> 30:04.530
You take everyone else out

30:04.550 --> 30:05.750
and go find Zhu Yifei.

30:06.070 --> 30:07.270
And after we find him?

30:07.400 --> 30:08.460
After you find him,

30:08.550 --> 30:09.690
don't alert him.

30:09.830 --> 30:11.290
Figure out what he's up to.

30:11.480 --> 30:13.280
If he dares to move against me...

30:13.590 --> 30:14.320
Understood.

30:32.000 --> 30:32.860
It worked, bro.

30:32.880 --> 30:33.540
Put me down.

30:36.000 --> 30:36.400
Here.

30:36.510 --> 30:37.040
Alright.

30:38.070 --> 30:38.780
Bro,

30:39.070 --> 30:39.870
I'll go first.

30:40.110 --> 30:40.870
No.

30:41.000 --> 30:42.680
I'm worried the rope might not be
strong enough.

30:42.680 --> 30:43.660
I'll go up first.

31:14.110 --> 31:15.310
Come on, bro. Come up.

31:17.800 --> 31:18.730
Come up. Come on.

31:30.000 --> 31:30.960
A bit higher.

31:47.440 --> 31:47.880
Bro,

31:50.270 --> 31:51.720
let's go down the mountain

31:51.720 --> 31:52.780
and find some food.

31:54.110 --> 31:55.510
Why go down the mountain?

31:59.880 --> 32:01.270
We're going in during the day?

32:01.270 --> 32:02.070
What's wrong?

32:04.160 --> 32:05.420
It's such a big estate—

32:05.590 --> 32:06.070
there are definitely people

32:06.070 --> 32:07.240
guarding it.

32:07.680 --> 32:08.240
People?

32:10.030 --> 32:11.760
I'm so hungry I'd eat anything.

32:12.350 --> 32:13.220
Eat people?

32:13.670 --> 32:15.600
I couldn't bring myself to do that.

32:17.440 --> 32:19.700
You're still bound by morals and ethics.

32:20.440 --> 32:21.590
Open a history book—

32:22.550 --> 32:25.810
every page is filled with stories of
people eating people.

32:26.590 --> 32:27.850
Bro, let me.

32:38.160 --> 32:38.830
My turn.

32:47.830 --> 32:48.360
Let's go.

33:11.070 --> 33:11.510
Bro.

33:12.590 --> 33:13.680
They've all left.

33:14.350 --> 33:15.480
Our chance has come.

33:19.640 --> 33:20.570
It's God's will.

33:22.480 --> 33:23.480
These past few days, God has been

33:23.480 --> 33:25.070
testing our patience.

34:03.260 --> 34:05.740
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

34:06.700 --> 34:08.030
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

34:09.520 --> 34:11.929
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

34:12.810 --> 34:14.250
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

34:15.360 --> 34:16.230
♪ Oh Gimme ♪

34:17.340 --> 34:19.190
♪ Dance me in the richness ♪

34:20.480 --> 34:21.980
♪ Raining make it rain ♪

34:22.610 --> 34:25.230
♪ Oh cash is my revolution ♪

34:28.260 --> 34:30.670
♪ Get your head in the game,
we're all smart people here ♪

34:31.380 --> 34:34.050
♪ Don't drag your feet,
even gold slips through slow hands ♪

34:34.870 --> 34:36.420
♪ I beat it, I beat it ♪

34:37.280 --> 34:39.199
♪ Aye aye aye aye yo ♪

34:43.159 --> 34:45.449
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

34:46.670 --> 34:47.830
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

34:49.290 --> 34:51.860
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

34:52.840 --> 34:54.320
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

34:59.190 --> 35:01.470
♪ Tore down the kang in my old home,
dug up a pixiu ♪

35:01.990 --> 35:06.320
♪ Ancestors bless me—
your boy's on the rise now ♪

35:09.560 --> 35:10.710
♪ Hit the streets to buy New Year goods ♪

35:11.230 --> 35:13.700
♪ Hit the streets to buy New Year goods,
haggling prices down ♪

35:14.440 --> 35:17.750
♪ Whatever's expensive, I'll buy it—
today it's all about splurging ♪

35:23.060 --> 35:25.510
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

35:26.570 --> 35:27.730
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

35:29.190 --> 35:31.760
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

35:32.740 --> 35:34.520
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

35:54.760 --> 35:56.690
I haven't tried Bowen's birthday.

36:08.110 --> 36:10.110
Or maybe it's Yangyang's birthday.

36:40.360 --> 36:41.290
Are you leaving?

36:44.190 --> 36:44.720
Mr. Zhou.

36:46.640 --> 36:47.880
Who sent you?

36:50.320 --> 36:51.800
Du Cong introduced me.

36:53.280 --> 36:55.030
You didn't come earlier or later—

36:55.030 --> 36:56.160
had to be today, huh?

36:57.960 --> 36:59.090
Who exactly are you?

37:04.510 --> 37:05.600
We've met before.

37:05.800 --> 37:06.760
Don't you remember?

37:06.760 --> 37:09.030
The day of the rear-end collision, right?

37:09.030 --> 37:10.960
That wasn't a coincidence, was it?

37:12.710 --> 37:14.510
It indeed wasn't a coincidence,

37:15.920 --> 37:17.320
but fate's arrangement.

37:20.110 --> 37:21.710
You've got a sense of humor, huh?

37:21.710 --> 37:22.590
I like you.

37:23.840 --> 37:25.500
Let's go inside and talk more—

37:27.000 --> 37:28.530
about fate's arrangement.

37:34.360 --> 37:35.320
Hurry up and eat.

37:35.400 --> 37:36.860
We've still got work to do.

38:01.840 --> 38:04.420
Who are you?

38:10.510 --> 38:11.840
W-What's that noise?

38:13.960 --> 38:14.650
Gai.

38:14.960 --> 38:15.970
A chick came

38:16.190 --> 38:17.720
looking for Mr. Zhou today.

38:31.190 --> 38:31.840
Can't you pay a bit more attention

38:31.840 --> 38:33.020
to your image?

38:33.590 --> 38:34.320
You know, Chao,

38:34.320 --> 38:35.320
it's been 5 years.

38:35.840 --> 38:38.500
The elastic in my pants
has pretty much worn out.

38:38.710 --> 38:39.510
If people see this,

38:39.510 --> 38:42.440
they'll get the wrong idea
that we're just perverts.

38:43.880 --> 38:44.360
Chao.

38:45.400 --> 38:46.920
This scene right now

38:47.000 --> 38:49.800
really does make it hard
not to get any wrong ideas.

38:56.230 --> 38:58.160
Looks like we can only go like this.

39:02.320 --> 39:04.120
Why are you going to such lengths

39:04.590 --> 39:05.590
to get close to me?

39:08.760 --> 39:10.220
Which girl in Sanjiangkou

39:10.590 --> 39:11.590
wouldn't want to get close to you?

39:11.590 --> 39:13.050
I know what they're after.

39:13.630 --> 39:14.690
But what about you?

39:17.030 --> 39:18.280
I'm not like them.

39:19.480 --> 39:20.940
They're just after money.

39:23.190 --> 39:24.450
And what are you after?

39:30.030 --> 39:31.490
You're kind of scaring me.

39:34.590 --> 39:36.450
Let's have a drink first and talk.

39:43.320 --> 39:45.450
I'm also used to talking after a drink.

40:07.910 --> 40:09.310
What are you looking for?

40:11.030 --> 40:12.430
I-I'm checking the time.

40:26.440 --> 40:26.960
You're

40:27.920 --> 40:29.920
here looking for this phone, right?

40:31.640 --> 40:33.440
The car crash that day was arranged
by you guys.

40:33.440 --> 40:35.020
You are with Du Cong.

40:35.320 --> 40:36.760
I'm not with him.

40:39.030 --> 40:40.300
Du Cong went to pick someone up

40:40.300 --> 40:41.900
and isn't in the villa today.

40:44.190 --> 40:45.940
You're with Zhu Yifei then.

40:46.130 --> 40:48.130
You guys came for this phone, right?

40:49.070 --> 40:49.880
What are you talking about?

40:49.880 --> 40:50.840
Still pretending!

40:50.840 --> 40:52.000
Zhu Yifei's deal with me

40:52.000 --> 40:52.800
was just a cover!

40:52.800 --> 40:53.480
You guys are just here

40:53.480 --> 40:54.510
to get the password to this phone,

40:54.510 --> 40:55.110
aren't you?

40:55.110 --> 40:56.170
What are you doing?

40:56.630 --> 40:58.180
Trying to hit me now?

40:59.360 --> 41:00.440
What are you thinking?

41:00.440 --> 41:01.440
Trying to escape?

41:01.440 --> 41:02.520
This place is full of my people.

41:02.520 --> 41:03.460
Don't even think about escaping!
